WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.360
When would you like to do it?

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.919
We think timing is important.

00:00:02.919 --> 00:00:04.679
What day and what time?

00:00:04.679 --> 00:00:08.519
Is it better first thing or after school or before bed?

00:00:08.519 --> 00:00:10.160
What about weekend or weekday?

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.880
For instance, an answer may be after school

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.679
or on a Saturday morning.

